      "id": "zwqhu87",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.1 Major Tribes of Arunachal Pradesh"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Arunachal Pradesh features a rich diversity of major indigenous tribes, each with distinct heritage.",
        "Major festivals across the state are closely linked with agricultural cycles and indigenous rituals.",
        "The state exhibits profound linguistic variety with various tribal languages and dialects.",
        "Traditional dress and woven attire signify tribal identity, status, and artistic heritage.",
        "Donyi-Polo represents the traditional indigenous spiritual system centered on the Sun and Moon."
      ],
      "id": "kqson4a"
    },
